One unit, the text diff: its parts (the view, its rows and cards, the find widget, the overview strip, the gaps, the composer, the notices, the patch colors and the caches they share) share crate-private types (DiffView, DiffInputs, Selection, LineAnchor, DiffKey), and the rendered Markdown diff, the folder summary and the Files tab build on them together.
The parts that stand on their own live in sub-folders: diff_view/, diff_overview/ and find/.
